---
---
<section id="about" aria-labelledby="about-h" class="about-section">
  <div class="about-col-main">
    <h2 id="about-h" class="about-title">About us</h2>
    <p>
      Oakline is a two-person shop. Dana mills and joins; Peter finishes and delivers. We have made furniture on Wealthy Street since 2014, from hardwood bought within 200 miles of the shop.
    </p>
    <p style="margin-top: 16px;">
      Every joint is mechanical — mortise, tenon, dovetail — so a piece can be taken apart and repaired instead of replaced. Send us a photo if something breaks, whenever that happens; repairs on our own work are free for the first ten years.
    </p>
  </div>
  
  <div class="about-col-contact">
    <h3 class="overline-header">Visit or write</h3>
    <ul class="contact-list">
      <li>418 Wealthy Street SE<br />Grand Rapids, MI 49503</li>
      <li>Tuesday–Saturday, 10am–6pm</li>
      <li><a href="tel:+16165550142">(616) 555-0142</a></li>
      <li><a href="mailto:shop@oaklinefurniture.example">shop@oaklinefurniture.example</a></li>
    </ul>
    <p class="delivery-note">
      Free delivery and assembly within 90 miles. Flat-rate $180 crating anywhere else in the lower 48.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Shop Admin Portal -->
  <aside id="admin" aria-labelledby="admin-h" class="admin-card">
    <h3 id="admin-h" class="overline-header">Admin</h3>
    <p class="admin-intro">Shop staff only. Sign in to edit prices, stock status and photos.</p>
    <form action="#" method="post" class="admin-form" onsubmit="alert('Admin portal mockup — Authentication requires server-side credentials.'); return false;">
      <div class="form-field">
        <label for="admin-email">Staff email</label>
        <input id="admin-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="username" required placeholder="staff@oaklinefurniture.example" />
      </div>
      <div class="form-field">
        <label for="admin-pass">Password</label>
        <input id="admin-pass" name="password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required />
      </div>
      <button type="submit" class="btn-signin">Sign in</button>
    </form>
    <ul class="admin-links">
      <li><a href="/products.json" target="_blank">Edit catalogue (items.json)</a></li>
      <li><a href="#admin" onclick="alert('Viewing open orders requires staff authentication.'); return false;">Open orders · 7</a></li>
      <li><a href="mailto:dana@oaklinefurniture.example">Reset a staff password</a></li>
    </ul>
    <p class="build-timestamp">Last catalogue build: 1 August 2026, 9:12am</p>
  </aside>
</section>

<style>
  .about-section {
    margin: 96px 0 0;
    padding: 56px 0 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.3fr) minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(0, 0.95fr);
    gap: 48px;
  }
  .about-title {
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 40px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .about-col-main p {
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .overline-header {
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-subtle);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .contact-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: grid;
    gap: 12px;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .delivery-note {
    margin: 22px 0 0;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-subtle);
  }

  .admin-card {
    background: #EFEAE2;
    border: 1px solid rgba(28, 26, 23, 0.16);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 26px;
    align-self: start;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  }
  .admin-intro {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .admin-form {
    display: grid;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .form-field {
    display: grid;
    gap: 6px;
  }
  .form-field label {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .form-field input {
    height: 42px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(28, 26, 23, 0.24);
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: #FFFDFA;
    padding: 0 12px;
    font: 400 14px/1.2 var(--font-sans);
    color: var(--text-dark);
    width: 100%;
    transition: border-color 0.2s;
  }
  .form-field input:focus {
    border-color: var(--accent-terracotta);
    outline: none;
  }
  .btn-signin {
    height: 46px;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--text-dark);
    color: #F6F2EC;
    font: 500 15px/1 var(--font-sans);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background-color 0.2s ease;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }
  .btn-signin:hover {
    background: var(--accent-terracotta);
  }
  .admin-links {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 20px 0 0;
    padding: 18px 0 0;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(28, 26, 23, 0.16);
    display: grid;
    gap: 10px;
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .build-timestamp {
    margin: 16px 0 0;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-subtle);
  }

  @media (max-width: 992px) {
    .about-section {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 36px;
    }
  }
</style>
